==English==

===Etymology===
Attested since about 1790, from {{bor|en|la|centēnārius||of one hundred}}, from {{m|la|centēnī||one hundred each}} (from {{m|la|centum||hundred}} + {{m|la|-arius}}). {{doublet|en|kantar|quintal}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of, pertaining to, or completing a period of 100 years.
#: {{syn|en|centennial}}
# Relating to a [[hundred]] of anything.

